  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Lucy Easton was over 200 years old when we cured her. So, yes, when the cursed magic sustaining her was removed, she became unsustainable.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "At least that was our observation in the Mortal Plain. If the hypothesis serves, these two - who had only just turned - should be fine.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC08A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Should be?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Quincy_Morris_DM-HOWL_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634687,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "In all likelihood. At the very least, they are cleansed of the curse. The same cannot be said for the Outsider.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_024.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC06A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What! I... I... Oh, Keziah! She would know! Oh, but you haven't found her yet.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderSuspectF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Tranett_DM-HOWL_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634680,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, Scion, I could cure all of the Outsiders if they were infected. And no, it won't cost you a thing, save your assistance.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_025.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The cure is a complex combination of potion and ritual and I need ingredients to mix up more potions. Help me gather them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_026.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC06A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I guess I should just follow that map of yours to Queen Glorina and the others. Oh, but don't forget poor Ignacio!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderSuspectF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Tranett_DM-HOWL_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634680,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC07A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If we are truly cured, then we can return to the camp and inform the others of your progress. And, please, try and find Anne while you are here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/John_Seward_DM-HOWL_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634686,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC07A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She escaped before we were turned; she should be uncorrupted.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/John_Seward_DM-HOWL_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1634686,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, yes, hero, hero. Now let us get to the real work. We need Silver for the anti-Were potion. Scavenge it from the discarded weapons of long lost wars.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-HOWL-NPC04E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That silver we gathered should keep them at bay... or give them a nasty burn.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Runa_DM-HOWL_043.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1624416,
